# �️ OSINT India Platform - Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your API keys

# YouTube Data API v3 Key (REQUIRED for live news)
# STEP-BY-STEP SETUP:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project (or select existing)
# 3. Go to "APIs & Services" > "Library"
# 4. Search for "YouTube Data API v3" and enable it
# 5. Go to "APIs & Services" > "Credentials"
# 6. Click "Create Credentials" > "API key"
# 7. Copy the API key and paste it below
# 8. (Optional) Restrict the key to YouTube Data API v3 only for security
VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_api_key_here

# GNews API Key (optional - for news articles)
# Get it from: https://gnews.io/register
VITE_NEWS_API_KEY=your_gnews_api_key_here

# Note: In development mode, the app will use mock data if API keys are not provided
# In production, API keys are required for full functionality
